{"3575380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dungeon Escape", "steam_appid": 3575380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeon Escape – A 3D Co-Op Puzzle Adventure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped deep underground, your only goal is to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dungeon Escape</i> is a thrilling 3D escape game set in a mysterious and dangerous dungeon. Play solo or team up with up to 4 players in online co-op as you work your way through a series of intricate rooms, each filled with unique puzzles and secrets to uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your wits, teamwork, and observation skills to solve challenging riddles and uncover the path forward. Every room brings a new twist – and only those who think outside the box will find the way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you make it to the surface?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3D first-person escape experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co-op for 1 to 4 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of hand-crafted rooms and puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric dungeon setting </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Teamwork-based and solo puzzle mechanics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is our very first game – thank you so much for playing!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👉 Join our Discord server to report bugs and get the latest news about upcoming games. These will appear in a variety of different genres.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeon Escape – A 3D Co-Op Puzzle Adventure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trapped deep underground, your only goal is to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dungeon Escape</i> is a thrilling 3D escape game set in a mysterious a